WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.680
Now, that is an incredibly important thing.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:09.017
To see your background, your experience,

00:00:09.017 --> 00:00:12.335
your&nbsp;history represented 
out there in the world,

00:00:12.335 --> 00:00:14.873
having a voice, speaking on a platform,

00:00:14.873 --> 00:00:18.183
doing&nbsp;the things that perhaps you
 hope that you would be able to do.

00:00:18.183 --> 00:00:20.062
If you can't see yourself out there

00:00:20.062 --> 00:00:22.200
or anyone who looks like you 
or sounds like you,

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:24.893
it's very hard to imagine

00:00:24.893 --> 00:00:26.911
that you'll be&nbsp;able to do that as well.

00:00:26.911 --> 00:00:28.320
And that’s one part

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:31.549
of what was incredibly important,

00:00:31.549 --> 00:00:34.000
I've realized&nbsp;over the years,

00:00:34.391 --> 00:00:36.068
of what was incredibly important about

00:00:36.068 --> 00:00:38.803
me being able to have the life 
and the&nbsp;opportunities

00:00:38.803 --> 00:00:41.251
and the career that I've had.

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:43.509
But it's only one part.

00:00:44.119 --> 00:00:46.431
I've realized more&nbsp;and more 
as time has gone on

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:48.743
how much I owe

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.672
everything, all the opportunities I've had,

00:00:51.672 --> 00:00:53.257
to other people

00:00:53.257 --> 00:00:54.721
and the work of other people.

